385
00:19:22,040 --> 00:19:23,560
Everything, sir?

386
00:19:24,140 --> 00:19:24,640
Yes

387
00:19:24,640 --> 00:19:26,100
Pay attention, Gon

388
00:19:26,100 --> 00:19:28,160
Show him everything you've learned

389
00:19:28,160 --> 00:19:30,100
At the same time

390
00:19:30,100 --> 00:19:37,600
Everything I've learned at the same time

391
