408
00:20:23,380 --> 00:20:29,020
I want you to reflect on each of the things that you're capable of

409
00:20:29,020 --> 00:20:34,920
After Mr. Wing helped unleash my nen

410
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:37,140
I got seriously hurt in battle

411
00:20:37,140 --> 00:20:39,240
Because all I really knew how to do was ten

412
00:20:39,240 --> 00:20:42,980
But I mastered Zetsu in the process

413
00:20:42,980 --> 00:20:44,740
Then I learned Gyo

414
00:20:44,740 --> 00:20:47,080
So I could see through Hisoka's special ability

415
00:20:47,080 --> 00:20:49,220
Gyo

416
00:20:49,220 --> 00:20:50,620
Oh yeah

417
00:20:50,620 --> 00:20:51,940
