427
00:21:11,940 --> 00:21:13,660
I can do them all at once

428
00:21:13,660 --> 00:21:24,200
I did it!

429
00:21:27,800 --> 00:21:29,300
It's no use

430
00:21:29,300 --> 00:21:31,480
