434
00:21:38,700 --> 00:21:40,720
How much power could I have?

435
00:21:42,920 --> 00:21:44,060
I want to see

436
00:21:44,060 --> 00:21:45,760
I have to try it out!

437
00:21:47,140 --> 00:21:48,700
Haste makes waste, Gon

438
00:21:48,700 --> 00:21:51,260
Os!

439
00:21:52,620 --> 00:21:53,760
Sounds like a breakthrough

440
00:21:53,760 --> 00:21:57,160
But you're still not gonna beat me!

